review_text:
I really enjoyed playing this game. 

Fun and interesting campaign mode with two different endings depending on your choices;
Creative lore behind the game. A communist country during late 70s and early 80s with its own language. Something like Russian mixed with Polish and Czech, quite amusing;
Smooth gameplay with nice gunfight scenarios and engaging side missions;
It also has two additional game modes: a free mode where you upgrade buildings, hire and promote staff, and complete side missions to earn money; and a challenge mode that requires an online connection to compete with other players for the best rank

I highly recommend this game. It's a perfect choice to relax and have some fun.
